{"id":1,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自主自律と探究を重ねるお茶の水附属","feature_description":"お茶の水女子大学附属中学校は「自主自律の精神をもち、広い視野に立って行動する生徒」の育成を目標に掲げます。基礎的・基本的な学力を充実させ、個性を生かす学習指導を行います。カリキュラムや帰国生徒教育の研究成果を生かして、探究する楽しさを見いだす教育課程を編成。生活指導では基本的な生活習慣と自主性・自治の意識を育て、進路指導では個性を生かす選択を支えます。","clubs":[{"id":112,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fz.ocha.ac.jp/ft/menu/schoollife/d001940.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":113,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fz.ocha.ac.jp/ft/menu/schoollife/d001940.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":114,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fz.ocha.ac.jp/ft/menu/schoollife/d001940.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":115,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fz.ocha.ac.jp/ft/menu/schoollife/d001940.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":116,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fz.ocha.ac.jp/ft/menu/schoollife/d001940.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":117,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fz.ocha.ac.jp/ft/menu/schoollife/d001940.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":118,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fz.ocha.ac.jp/ft/menu/schoollife/d001940.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":119,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fz.ocha.ac.jp/ft/menu/schoollife/d001940.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":120,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fz.ocha.ac.jp/ft/menu/schoollife/d001940.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":121,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fz.ocha.ac.jp/ft/menu/schoollife/d001940.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":122,"name":"文化創造部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fz.ocha.ac.jp/ft/menu/schoollife/d001940.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"}],"profile_sources":[{"id":1,"attribute_key":"religious_background","source_url":"https://www.nichinoken.co.j